msgstr "Una clase con ``__call__`` es la forma convencional::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/postprocessing/writing-your-own.rst:22
msgid ""
"A plain function works too -- the engine only checks that the object is "
"callable."
msgstr ""
"Una función simple también funciona -- el motor solo comprueba que el objeto"
" sea invocable."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/postprocessing/writing-your-own.rst:26
msgid "Hooking it in"
msgstr "Conectarlo"

